  "target_sha256": "6056139d78d9be98d2da8e64b2e7aab7c2946a130df392fa19af39a77963d578",
  "premises": [
    "Stable valid Swift object/type storage and ordinary Swift ARM64 ABI: self/contextX20, indirect resultX8, synchronous throwing errorX21 where shown by physical callers.",
    "Generic/unknown throwing-call semantics are not repaired or inferred from misleading pseudocode; item47 limitations persist.",
    "Selected static constructor/witness relations do not establish active runtime injection, invocation or successful I/O."
  ],
  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "F01",
      "classification": "observed-instructions-and-conditional-ABI-derivation",
      "claim": "Constructor writes thick pair (code100dba020, implementation object) to output+0x40. Thunk branches100dbb45c. Boost factory copies the complete96-byte result to staticglobal104622168; the constructed restore pair therefore occupies1046221a8/1046221b0. This is static construction, not active dependency selection or a restore invocation.",
      "sources": [
        "E07",
        "E08",
        "E09"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        "100db8e80..100db8e88",
        "100dba020",
        "10118c57c..10118c598"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F02",
      "classification": "observed-instructions-and-conditional-ABI-derivation",
      "claim": "Queue adapter100dbb45c stores (implementation-self,incomingx0) in its capture, passes code100dc4378/context to Dispatch.sync, and forwards its indirect Optional result buffer. No direct B/BL to100dbe518 is present in this adapter. Callback body100dc4378 is a missing public boundary in this review.",
      "sources": [
        "E05",
        "E06"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        "100dbb470",
        "100dbb484",
        "100dbb498..100dbb4b0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F03",
      "classification": "observed-instructions",
      "claim": "Enumeration helper100dbe848 derives the parent URL and base filename, invokes ObjCstub103647a40 with an error-out pointer, bridges a nonnil return to[String], builds candidate URLs in increasing source-array order, applies100dc1658 and appends only present parsed records. It then passes comparator100dc1ff8 to100dc2270 with an inout record array. The latter helpers are not public-body sources in this review; no newest-first ordering is established.",
      "sources": [
        "E01"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        "100dbeab0..100dbeac4",
        "100dbeb28..100dbeb70",
        "100dbec2c..100dbed8c",
        "100dbef04..100dbef90",
        "100dbf024..100dbf050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F04",
      "classification": "observed-instructions-and-conditional-ABI-derivation",
      "claim": "A nil enumeration result takes100dbee1c; its NSError is converted, swift_willThrow is called, then the converted error is released and an empty array returned. Do not call this propagated caller failure. Unexpected parser/sort errors instead reach retained brk paths100dbf0b0/0cc; normal-return claims presume those helpers return normally.",
      "sources": [
        "E01",
        "E02"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        "100dbeb5c",
        "100dbee1c..100dbee60",
        "100dbef08",
        "100dbf044",
        "100dbf0b0..100dbf0d4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F05",
      "classification": "observed-instructions-and-conditional-ABI-derivation",
      "claim": "Restore leaf100dbe518 iterates record indices from0 upward. It obtains a record flag offset from metadata+0x14 and skips if bit0 is clear. For an eligible record it invokes readImpl100dbf0d8 withw1=0 and the incoming decoder-info value. A nonzero read error inx21 is released, Optional.none is formed, x21 is cleared, and the loop advances.",
      "sources": [
        "E03"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        "100dbe698..100dbe6c8",
        "100dbe718..100dbe738",
        "100dbe73c..100dbe76c",
        "100dbe6cc..100dbe6e0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F06",
      "classification": "observed-instructions-and-conditional-ABI-derivation",
      "claim": "The first eligible read returning Optional.some is copied through type value witnesses to the original result pointer and tagged present. Exhausted/empty candidate lists return Optional.none. Success means decoded return value, not writeback or restored filesystem state.",
      "sources": [
        "E03"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        "100dbe784..100dbe798",
        "100dbe7f0..100dbe83c",
        "100dbe7b0..100dbe7cc"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F07",
      "classification": "bounded-negative-observation",
      "claim": "No save/file-replacement call is constructed within the retained100dbe518 body. The ordinary readImpl body handles selected failures by backup/error handling rather than invoking this separate restore leaf. An invoking application caller and any later writeback are unproved; neither global absence nor automatic recovery follows.",
      "sources": [
        "E03",
        "E10"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        "100dbe518..100dbe844",
        "100dbf0d8..100dbfb5c"
      ]
    }
  ],
